{
  "_doc": "Tier-1 post office on Church Lane (Pell's Crossing, lot 'post_office', front faces the lane, opposite the church). Route: front doors deadbolted -> the box lobby (open 24 h) -> through the pried-out box wall into the sorting room (a bear trap just inside) -> behind the counter to the postmaster's office (Benning; the cage key on its hook) -> the dock door is nailed shut: down to the basement (dead letters), along to the carriers' room, up the dock stair -> the registry's parcel cage (loot: searching it wakes the carriers in the dock) -> unbolt the dock door. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
